# <type>(<scope>): <JIRA-KEY> <subject>      (<= 100 chars; key required, e.g. FUT-123)
#   e.g. feat(planner): FUT-123 add group viewer to the board
#
# type:  feat fix chore docs refactor test ci build perf style revert
# scope: optional module/area; use (deps) for dependency bumps (key not required)
#
# Body (optional): what & why, wrap at ~72 cols.
#
# Footer (optional): Closes: FUT-123  /  BREAKING CHANGE: ...
